{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p003229","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p003229"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p003229","label":"張良（齊悼惠王世家候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"留侯張良","mention_ids":["c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m012-0057"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m012-0057","chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p012","quote":"留侯張良"}]}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m012-0057","start":57,"end":61,"surface":"留侯張良","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003229","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p012","chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji052-022","person_id":"cbr-p003229","title":"留侯","kind":"noble_rank","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","source_id":"s-shiji-052-qidaohui","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p012","quote":"瑯邪王既行，齊遂舉兵西攻呂國之濟南。於是齊哀王遺諸侯王書曰：「高帝平定天下，王諸子弟，悼惠王於齊。悼惠王薨，惠帝使留侯張良立臣為齊王。惠帝崩，高后用事，春秋高，聽諸呂擅廢高帝所立，又殺三趙王，滅梁、燕、趙以王諸呂，分齊國為四。忠臣進諫，上惑亂不聽。今高后崩，皇帝春秋富，未能治天下，固恃大臣諸（將）［侯］。今諸呂又擅自尊官，聚兵嚴威，劫列侯忠臣，矯制以令天下，宗廟所以危。今寡人率兵入誅不當為王者。」"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji052-022:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p012","start":57,"end":59,"surface":"留侯","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m012-0057","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"授予、任事、提議、回敘及用稱分開；年號僅留原語，不反算公曆起訖。朱虛、東牟許封趙梁而未實現不記實授，死亡不自動終止全部稱號。章與興居授王兩處年表述各留原段，不擅調和。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji052-016","person_id":"cbr-p003229","surfaces":["留侯張良"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-052-qidaohui"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p012","quote":"瑯邪王既行，齊遂舉兵西攻呂國之濟南。於是齊哀王遺諸侯王書曰：「高帝平定天下，王諸子弟，悼惠王於齊。悼惠王薨，惠帝使留侯張良立臣為齊王。惠帝崩，高后用事，春秋高，聽諸呂擅廢高帝所立，又殺三趙王，滅梁、燕、趙以王諸呂，分齊國為四。忠臣進諫，上惑亂不聽。今高后崩，皇帝春秋富，未能治天下，固恃大臣諸（將）［侯］。今諸呂又擅自尊官，聚兵嚴威，劫列侯忠臣，矯制以令天下，宗廟所以危。今寡人率兵入誅不當為王者。」"}],"rationale":"依明示名與王國、世次的局部敘事暫接；齊、城陽與菑川同諡者分開，興居與志分開。校勘建延及內史勳士未擅選讀法，未名帝后不補姓名，案件只保存來源敘事。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p012","text":"瑯邪王既行，齊遂舉兵西攻呂國之濟南。於是齊哀王遺諸侯王書曰：「高帝平定天下，王諸子弟，悼惠王於齊。悼惠王薨，惠帝使留侯張良立臣為齊王。惠帝崩，高后用事，春秋高，聽諸呂擅廢高帝所立，又殺三趙王，滅梁、燕、趙以王諸呂，分齊國為四。忠臣進諫，上惑亂不聽。今高后崩，皇帝春秋富，未能治天下，固恃大臣諸（將）［侯］。今諸呂又擅自尊官，聚兵嚴威，劫列侯忠臣，矯制以令天下，宗廟所以危。今寡人率兵入誅不當為王者。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m012-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"瑯邪王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003225","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m012-0020","start":20,"end":23,"surface":"齊哀王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003220","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m012-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003215","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m012-0043","start":43,"end":46,"surface":"悼惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003214","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m012-0049","start":49,"end":52,"surface":"悼惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003214","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m012-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"惠帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003216","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m012-0057","start":57,"end":61,"surface":"留侯張良","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003229","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m012-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"齊王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p003220","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-